Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.33,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.33,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.75,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the target I'm waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.75,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to talk to others into\Ngiving Ken a second chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no, they wouldn't go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you who I don't trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That crazy white-haired lady Palmon saw\Ndoing something freaky to a control spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She turned it into Golemon, and he tried\Nto destroy a dam and flood the local town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I call a bad attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.82,0:01:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Digimon were fighting the\Ngood white, but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll live in shame when Mimi\Nand I called Ken for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when she finally admitted to\Nherself that she was wrong about Ken,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon digivaled into his champion form,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he had it in him.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(192,375)\c&HF4F9ED&}Jogress Evolution
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(356,413)\c&HF4F9ED&}Now, Two Hearts Become One
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jogress Shinka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iman, I'm one of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.70,0:02:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, Iman, watch what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to yell at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right. We need a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any wishes yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, I wonder, do you think it's possible\Nthat Ken's in some kind of danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman that Palmon was telling us\Nabout, I just know that she's up to no good,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I think he might be in her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look on the bright side, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least no one will\Never say you think small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly have a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're my creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even I don't understand\Nhow Aru Kunemon can take one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my control spires and\Nsomehow turn it into a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was the Digimon Emperor,\NI understood this sort of thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but nothing makes sense to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth to Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad someone still has faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I just have to have faith in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I was the one\Nwho built these things,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd think I would have some\Nkind of clue as to how they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the Digimon Emperor, I was a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm just playing kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as far as you're concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon, looking at these things\Nmakes me sick to my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick your head between your\Nknees and take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole thing is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how many times do I have to\Ntell you it's not your fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are people you can\Ntalk to about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why didn't you talk to them\Nbefore becoming the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had to be easier than\Nbuilding control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent question, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't figure out how they work,\Nthen I'll just have to knock them all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems sturdy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I know what I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, even if it is what\Nwe were all thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that rock slide\Nthing wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Flamedermond.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.23,0:04:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was too. Was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those meddling kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when I had the DigiWorld\Nso deliciously destroyed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A split end?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirit Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bridge offends me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you said give me\Nthe rock on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's headed for the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's just admiring\Nthe detailed architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, or a way to blow\Nit up. No! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Storm of Friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earthquake Drill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minotaromon is a champion\NDigimon with a nasty left jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This earthquake drill will turn\Nthat bridge into stepping stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my bridge! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunderfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:05:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking a swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very funny, TP. A little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is gonna mess this up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bay! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's a control spire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's real enough! Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, Armored Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Armored Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon, Angel of Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon, Flying Hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunderblast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, now you're talking? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he took a big bite out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, I feel so violated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still respect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna have to rebuild it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'll be easier this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really learned a lot\Nfrom all our mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and this will give you\Nthe chance to make new mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, but I liked my old mistakes better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, speaking of mistakes,\Nwe should ask Ken to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the support.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I bet he'd jump\Nat the chance to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be right, but he's\Nthe only one who can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm just not comfortable around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard for people to really change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a point, but I have a\Ngood feeling about him, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had seen what I saw,\Nyou'd believe in him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, his crest of kindness\Nturned into a golden Digi-Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the most amazing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to think I'm\Ncrazy when I say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I guess you already think\NI'm crazy, so here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Digi-Egg believed in him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it was like it was telling\Nme I could believe in him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It almost felt like it was asking\Nme to go ahead and trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that's not very logical,\Nbut then again, neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is he has to have the\NCrest of Kindness for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about his Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He believes in him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.28,0:08:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's because Wormmon\Nknew it was in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if you're wrong, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, he's made it clear he\Ndoesn't want to be part of our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, but I'm an optimist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.36,0:09:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goody for you, but realistically,\Nhe could still be bad to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Cody is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He usually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm bored, and all this talk\Nisn't getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, that crazy white-haired\Nchick is still out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she's up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a message from Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a real bizarre signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not too far from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it looks like the sector\Nwhere Ken's base went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to take a break, Stingmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I've wreaked\Nenough havoc for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, but you really need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ken, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have awfully short legs, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not to put too fine a point on it,\Nthese spires you built have splinters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Wyrmon, this isn't exactly\Na walk in the park, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, you're still a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have ice cream sundaes in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:10:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That does sound good, but would you\Nsettle for half a jelly roll at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's going on can you tell my theory is\Nthat a major power source is about to melt
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down if you guys don't\Nshut it down and i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fast it'll explode what\Ndo you mean explode
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i mean explode you know boom\Nthis is bad but what can we do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh the crest of kindness i'll bet it's\Nbecause ken's crest isn't there anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't care what anyone says we need\Nken's help and we need it now but davis
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.34,0:10:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are going to\Nhave to trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm right and we\Ndon't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel queasy. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's save the rest for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, isn't this just too domestic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, Ken, don't talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I come at a bad time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be going. Bye-bye. No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little friend there\Nis being quite rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're the one\Nwho keeps calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I want\Nanything from you, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why are you bothering me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do\Nto the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Ken, what a nosy little boy you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really none of\Nyour business, now is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you expect us to do, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, where's Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he was the Emperor, we\Nwere always tripping over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're using my control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:11:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think rather well of\Nyourself, little boy emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why did I do such awful things When I\Ncould have used my awesome powers for good
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Telephone, oh Ken Oh\Nyes, you're so special
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.83,0:12:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no The truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any pretty little boy would have been\Nas good You used me Of course I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you little fool
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Temper, temper But you always were so\Neasy to manipulate The perfect toy Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant to say tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.32,0:12:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you thought building the\Ncontrol spires was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Ichijoji residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ken's busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please hang up and\Ntry your call again later?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the operator?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem bright enough to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you heard about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to speak to Ken right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans with something to\Nprove are putty in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were particularly\Neasy to mold into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to mold me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must stop asking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, it was just a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not your whim, and I am not\Ngoing to let you get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you see, I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing you\Ncan do about it, poor Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just hang up on her. She's not a nice\Nwoman, and this is important. The Digital
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world is in trouble ken they need you\Nright away that boy davis is sending emails
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you knew about this didn't you\Nmaybe i did you need to get to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the digital world as soon as\Npossible and take your crest i think
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,davis may actually be right\Nthis time his theory is that The
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power source of your base can\Nonly be contained by your crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:13:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Emperor Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a little theory\Nof my own to check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very clever, but I'm still ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe we should\Nall move back a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're thinking too much again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because I have to\Nfind a way to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She used my pain and guilt to\Ncontrol me. I didn't mean it. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guilty of too much already mama\Npapa where's sam not this time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's getting worse
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so where's cat huh i'm\Nsure he's on his way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't count on it who\Ninvited her maybe can send
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His secretary instead.\NYou children are also
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terribly rude always\Ninterfering in my business
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy them. Well, now I've\Nseen it all. How does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do that thing i don't know\Nbut she's sure good at it oh
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cool mon is an ultimate digimon\Nstay clear of his double
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scissor claw attack he has\Na cutting sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's showtime, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fee-mon! Digi-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-mon are the tracks! Fee-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fee-mon! Digi-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon! Digimon! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know monsters, and are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ankylomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Blazer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Halo Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be kitty kibble if\NI could become Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't, so you'll just have\Nto do what you can, got me? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor-Armor-Dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jokumon-Armor-Digivalve-2!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor-Digivalve!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nebanygon-Angel-of-Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unamon-Digivalve-2!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unimon! Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double-Scissor-Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pac-Pot, no, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a face-face!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon's attack is most\Neffective against evil Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's not even a Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double scissor! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hero time, Wormmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon into champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Herrmann! Digimon, digital\Nmonsters! Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiking strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What took you so long? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, it's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he doubted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your crest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saving the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone else\Nto get hurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take this from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an ultimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'll do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a genius move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my base, my crest, and my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else is going\Nto die for my mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am as guilty as Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't stop him, you too. The only
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way I'll feel like a\Nhuman again instead of a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster Is to erase all\Ntrace of my evil to fix
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things and the only way to\Ndo that is with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:19:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Ken he still has nightmares\Nhorrible ones, but then mine are worse
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what happens to me\Nas long as I can accomplish my goal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of you big bad\Nwolf act He means lone wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I mean, what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you do\Nthis by yourself, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the people who care about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least think of your Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here, we're\Nhelping, and that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, itchy Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wake up, Stingmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your chance to stop him\Nfrom doing something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the genius, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is white. Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How will you fix your\Nmistakes if you're not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not be the sharpest tool in\Nthe shed, but I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess neither of us has\Nbeen thinking very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you messed up a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up. Fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:19:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just keep trying\Nuntil something works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it gets really bad,\Nyou hang with your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they're always your\Nfriends, even when you mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if you don't\Nhappen to have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.62,0:20:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear my heart beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's Ken's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what it feels\Nlike to have a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that bad, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Expimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D .N .A.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:20:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.37,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to\Nconnect with each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want me to\Nconnect with each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want me to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,connect with each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:22:03.17,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you connect with each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.17,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be love.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.18,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you're only one\Nperson, I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the\Npeople of three years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, on Digimon Adventure\N02! The Files of the Dragon. Now,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.31,0:22:59.31,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx110\fscy110\pos(315,325)}The Invincible Fusion! Paildramon{\c&HEFF4F2&}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the gate is open.

